* VyOS

#+name: vyosLogin
#+begin_src emacs-lisp
"vyos"
#+end_src

Excluded Repositories

#+NAME: vyosReposExclude
| .github |

#+name: vyosReposFetch
#+call: ghubReposFetch(login=vyosLogin)

Clone bundle sizes

#+name: vyosReposBundles
#+call: ghubReposBundles(repos=vyosReposFetch)

Clone bundles total

#+name: vyosReposBundlesTotal
#+call: ghubReposBundlesTotal(tbl=vyosReposBundles[,0])

** VyOS Repos

Filter the results, generate XML

#+name: vyosReposXML
#+call: ghubReposXML(repos=vyosReposFetch, reposExclude=vyosReposExclude, login=vyosLogin)

** Generate XML

Generate =vyos.xml=

#+begin_src xml :tangle vyos.xml :noweb yes
<manifest>
  <<vyosReposXML()>>
</manifest>
#+end_src

